{
  "desktop.win32.activateWindow": {
    "notes": "会话级命令，与 uia 侧同构。它会真的抢前台焦点。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "activates-the-session-window",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}"
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-session-is-explicit",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "no-such-session"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-session-string-falls-back-to-the-default-session",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": ""
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write"
        },
        "notes": "空会话串的实测语义（2026-09-22 执行层首跑校正）：`resolve_session_id` 把空串当「未提供」（`str(requested or '').strip()` 为空即回退），于是命令落到**默认会话**上，并不存在「拿空串去匹配某个会话」这一步——这才是『空串不是通配符』的真实含义。 本命令只吃会话，所以回退之后就是一次正常执行；`missing-session-is-explicit` 那条才是真正的失败路径。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.win32.attachWindow": {
    "notes": "比 uia 侧多一个 handle 参数（直连分支：不枚举、不按标题匹配，直接按句柄构造）。expect 的形状依据与 uia 侧同一组契约测试（test_desktop_contract.py / test_desktop_attach_window.py 断言两后端在这条命令上一致：outputs 四键、INVALID_INPUT、ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND + matchedCount / className）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "exact-title-binds-the-fixture-window",
        "notes": "显式给出 operationTimeoutMs 的一个取值（两侧覆盖要求）。",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "matchMode": "exact",
          "timeoutMs": 5000,
          "operationTimeoutMs": 2000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "resourceType": "windowHandle"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "resourceType",
            "processId",
            "workWindowId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "contains-mode-matches-a-title-substring",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "Desktop Demo",
          "matchMode": "contains",
          "timeoutMs": 5000,
          "operationTimeoutMs": 4000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "workWindowId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "regex-mode-matches-the-whole-title",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "^RPA Core .*Demo$",
          "matchMode": "regex",
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "handle-connects-without-any-title-matching",
        "notes": "handle 直连是 win32 侧独有的快路径：不枚举、不比标题。句柄由装配用 FindWindowW 现取（每次运行都不同，写不进表里）。",
        "inputs": {
          "handle": "{handle}",
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId",
            "workWindowId"
          ],
          "outputs": {
            "workWindowId": "{handle}"
          },
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-handle-is-not-found",
        "inputs": {
          "handle": "999999999",
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "EXECUTOR_FAILED"
        },
        "negative": true,
        "notes": "实测（2026-09-22 执行层首跑）：无效句柄**不是** `ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND`——pywinauto 直接抛（'Handle 999999999 is not a vaild window handle'，原文拼写如此），执行器统一包成`EXECUTOR_FAILED`。此前按 uia 侧直觉写成 ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND，是推断错误。"
      },
      {
        "name": "class-name-is-compared-by-equality-and-can-miss",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "className": "Notepad",
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND",
          "errorDetails": {
            "matchedCount": 0
          }
        },
        "negative": true,
        "notes": "className 恒为等值比较（matchMode 只管 title），配一个错的类名必然找不到。**details 形状与 uia 侧不同（实测）**：win32 的 ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND 只回带 `{title, matchedCount}`，没有 `className`——uia 侧两个都带。此前这条期望是从 uia 表抄过来的，首次执行就红。"
      },
      {
        "name": "no-filter-at-all-is-invalid-input",
        "inputs": {},
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "process-id-narrows-to-the-fixture-process",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "processId": "{pid}",
          "timeoutMs": 5000
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "processId": "{pid}"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "sessionId"
          ],
          "effect": "session"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-process-id-is-not-found",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "{appTitle}",
          "processId": 999999,
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-title-reports-zero-matches",
        "inputs": {
          "title": "no-such-window-rpa-core-probe",
          "timeoutMs": 200
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND",
          "errorDetails": {
            "matchedCount": 0
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.win32.click": {
    "notes": "纠正（2026-09-22）：此前写『靶子的 WinForms 控件匹配不到 win32 定位器，所以只有负路径』——实测 title 锚点可用（见 findElement 的 notes），因此本表补上真机正路径。元素用 countButton（title='Count'）：点它只让计数器加一，无其它副作用。『点下去真的生效』不在这里断言——矩阵一次只跑一条命令，读不到点击后的状态；实测已确认会生效（countLabel '0'→'1'），由 e2e 钉住。",
